## Stage 2 mechanics (discovered)
Folding /simplify into historical commits = a second rebuild from main:
cherry-pick each commit onto the progressively-simplified base, run /simplify
on that commit's diff, amend. Earlier cleanups change the base, so later
commits that touch the same hot files (hsim, e2e.sh, run_e2e.sh) may conflict
and need manual resolution. ~15 code-bearing commits warrant a /simplify pass;
~32 (docs/deletions/gitlink/asm) are no-ops and skipped.
